\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Augmented model. The physics step $f_{\mathrm  {base}}$ and the network $\phi _{\mathrm  {aug}}$ act in parallel on $\hat  x_k$. $\phi _{\mathrm  {aug}}$ gives $f_{\mathrm  {aug}}$ and $g_{\mathrm  {aug}}$, and the output map is not learned. The encoder $\psi $ sets $\hat  x$ at each window start. $f_{\mathrm  {base}}$ and $h_{\mathrm  {base}}$ use the physical part $\tilde  x_k$ of $\hat  x_k$.During training, the input is the closed-loop input of Section~\ref {sec:aug_loop}.  }}{5}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
